  "expirationDate": "2035-12-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes at chapter heading for Per 100) #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #10937, eff 9-22-15; renumbered by #14065-B; ss by #14435, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES 12-1-35",
